  m_Name: Guide_CustomerCodex
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PopLife.Data.OperationGuideData
  guideId: Guide_CustomerCodex
  displayName: Customer Codex
  description: 
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  sortOrder: 100
  activationMarker: 22
  pages:
  - screenshot: {fileID: 7227917649443183103, guid: 1eb4f553aac88eb499a01ac580ffa836, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex
    body: This is the Customer Codex. From here you can access information on every
      customer in the game! Scroll to see the list.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 9220391828954253308, guid: a1e15e7b66a4f4b4c80bf7cbdb2dd3a6, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customers in Store
    body: At the top here, you can see how many customers are currently in your store
      at this time.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 3221195490784552306, guid: 763948f30b4768f44a847b3188120260, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customer List
    body: On the left of the screen you can see the list of customers in the game
      that have visited your shop.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 5426093213676001169, guid: af0fa9bf6e5ef9b42b23cae1bac940c2, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Search and Filter
    body: You can search and through filter the customers here.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 668061551953147936, guid: 629eaffef0a17e24ba85611b5b4b615e, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customer
    body: 'When you click on a customer you will see: their name, their loyalty level,
      and their biography.'
  - screenshot: {fileID: 2112266969576048849, guid: 2c5ba04615f6af4448983614b9a4e25c, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customer Loyalty
    body: Here you can view the loyalty level of the customer.
  - screenshot: {fileID: -2420322087806991794, guid: a6a0fd6c3a2ac2e4b89f87f198d92701, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customer Favorite
    body: When you have the "favorite" tab clicked on, you will see the customer's
      favorite items below their biography.
  - screenshot: {fileID: 5708942291455286710, guid: baa89848ea0e2a94db00696fdb52f880, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - Customer Lifetime Stats
    body: When you have the "lifetime" tab clicked on, you will see the customer's
      lifetime statistics of visitng your store, including the amount of times they
      have visited the store as well as the total amount of money they have spent
      at the store.
  - screenshot: {fileID: -2257569283256787637, guid: 49203f9b53057f44b955e9ac7d1faca1, type: 3}
    title: Customer Codex - New Customer
    body: When you have gained a new customer that you have yet to look at in the
      codex they will appear like this!
